# The light Wild OS scheme (design v2 Mica): near-black ink on neutral light
# grey, accent deepened to #3563d8 with white text on it. Glass tokens are
# translucent; these are their solid equivalents for the parts of Qt that
# cannot draw translucency.
#
#   ink #1a1a1a         ink-muted ~#606060    window #f3f3f3
#   accent #3563d8      on-accent #ffffff     accent-text #2a55c4

